sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Client as Client
    participant Gateway as WS Gateway
    participant Redis as Redis
    participant Watcher as WSS A Watcher
    participant ManagerA as WSS A Manager
    participant HubA as WSS A Hub (old owner)
    participant Worker as Persist Worker
    participant ChatSvc as Chat Service
    participant RegistryC as WSS C Registry
    participant RouterC as WSS C Router
    participant ManagerC as WSS C Manager
    participant HubC as WSS C Hub (new owner)

    Note over Client, HubA: 초기 상태: room R owner = A, HubA가 sequence/fan-out 담당

    Note over Redis, ManagerC: 1. scale-out으로 C가 membership 등록
    RegistryC->>Redis: SET wss:member:C membership_token EX 30s
    Redis-->>Watcher: keyspace notification
    Watcher->>Redis: SCAN wss:member:*
    Watcher->>Watcher: ring.Set([A, B, C])
    Watcher-->>ManagerA: membership event

    Note over ManagerA, HubA: 2. 기존 owner가 owner mismatch 감지
    ManagerA->>ManagerA: active rooms snapshot
    ManagerA->>ManagerA: ring.Locate(R) != A
    ManagerA->>ManagerA: schedule close with jitter 0~2s
    ManagerA->>HubA: forceClose("room owner handoff")
    HubA->>HubA: draining=true<br/>new register/message reject

    Note over HubA, ChatSvc: 3. 기존 Hub가 저장 완료까지 drain
    loop 이미 HubA에 들어온 메시지
        HubA->>HubA: reserve persist slot<br/>sequence++<br/>local fan-out
        HubA->>Worker: persist task enqueue
        Worker->>ChatSvc: BatchCreateMessages
        ChatSvc-->>Worker: ack
        Worker-->>HubA: task ack<br/>pendingPersist--
    end

    HubA->>HubA: wait broadcastCh empty && pendingPersist == 0
    HubA->>Client: WebSocket close 1012<br/>room owner handoff
    HubA-->>ManagerA: done
    ManagerA->>Redis: EVAL release if token matches<br/>DEL wss:room:lease:R

    Note over Client, HubC: 4. 클라이언트 재접속과 새 owner 초기화
    Client->>Client: reconnect state + jittered backoff
    Client->>Gateway: GET /ws?room_id=R&ticket=new
    Gateway->>RouterC: proxy to C by updated ring
    RouterC->>ManagerC: PrepareRegister(R)
    ManagerC->>Redis: acquire wss:room:lease:R
    Redis-->>ManagerC: success
    ManagerC->>HubC: create Hub
    HubC->>ChatSvc: GetLastSequenceNumber(R)
    ChatSvc-->>HubC: last persisted sequence
    ManagerC-->>RouterC: ready
    RouterC-->>Gateway: 101 Switching Protocols
    Gateway-->>Client: hijack 후 양방향 터널

    Note over Client, HubC: 5. reconnect 후 정합성 보정
    Client->>ChatSvc: GET /rooms/R/messages?last_seq=maxSeq
    ChatSvc-->>Client: missed messages
    Client->>HubC: replay queued messages<br/>same client_msg_id
